# LIQUID-12 — Abstract repeated logic to snippets

## Rationale

Large monolithic sections with repeated or complex logic are hard to maintain,
test, and keep consistent. Centralize repeated blocks in snippets.

## How to check

Scan for duplicated Liquid blocks (same assign/if/render pattern appearing twice),
or sections/snippets with long repeated conditional markup.

## How to fix

Extract the shared logic into a snippet and `{% render %}` it with the varying
arguments.

## Examples

### Bad

```liquid
{% comment %} Same badge date/visibility logic duplicated twice {% endcomment %}
{% if product.metafields.display.badge.value != blank %}
  {% liquid
    assign show_badge = false
    if product.metafields.display.badge.value.end_date != null
      assign current_date = 'now' | date: '%s'
      ...
    endif
  %}
  {% if show_badge %}<span>...</span>{% endif %}
{% endif %}

{% for badge in variant.metafields.display.badges.value %}
  {% liquid
    assign show_badge = false
    if badge.end_date != null
      assign current_date = 'now' | date: '%s'
      ...
    endif
  %}
  {% if show_badge %}<span>...</span>{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
```

### Good

```liquid
{% if product.metafields.display.badge.value != blank %}
  {% render 'badge',
    text: product.metafields.display.badge.value.text,
    end_date: product.metafields.display.badge.value.end_date,
    badge_classes: badge_classes
  %}
{% endif %}

{% for badge in variant.metafields.display.badges.value %}
  {% render 'badge',
    text: badge.text,
    end_date: badge.end_date,
    badge_classes: badge_classes
  %}
{% endfor %}
```

The snippet should also avoid cache-breaking date logic; see LIQUID-06.
